BEGIN_TEXT
Every message waiting to go, on the air now, waiting for its
acknowledgement, or failed. A message goes when the radio is free, in
precedence order, and is tried again if no acknowledgement comes.

Held messages wait for something: a link to their station, a net slot
(as resent parts do), or the end of EMCON.
END
